 chance to freeze them.\n\t\tIf the target resists being frozen, it instead get wet.\n\t\tIf the target is wet the damage increases by 30%% and the ice freeze chance increases to 50%%.\n\t\tThis spell will never hit the caster.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"朝指定区域内的所有目标发射寒冰箭。每根寒冰箭缓慢飞行，命中时会击中目标周围所有相邻单位，造成 %0.2f 冰系伤害，并有 25%% 几率将其冻结。\n\t\t如果目标抵抗了冻结，则会使其湿润。\n\t\t如果目标处于湿润状态，伤害增加 30%%，同时冰冻率上升至 50%%。\n\t\t此法术不会伤害施法者。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}